<title>SWEDEN: Sweden to auction 10 bln SKR of T-bills.</title>
<headline>Sweden to auction 10 bln SKR of T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Debt Office said on Wednesday it would auction 10 billion crowns worth of treasury bills in two maturities.</p>
<p>Bids are due by 1030 GMT on July 23.</p>
<p>					  176-day bill	322-day bill</p>
<p> Maturity date			January 21, 1998  June 17, 1998</p>
<p> Volume to market (Billions Skr)   5.0		     5.0</p>
<p> Settlement date		    July 25	     July 25</p>
<p> Auction date			 July 23	     July 23</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
</text>
